{"ref": "Taanit 31a:2", "heRef": "תענית ל״א א:ב׳", "sectionRef": "Taanit 31a", "indexTitle": "Taanit", "heIndexTitle": "תענית", "categories": ["Talmud", "Bavli", "Seder Moed"], "next": null, "sectionNames": ["Daf", "Line"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99", "text": "רב מתנה אמר יום שנתנו הרוגי ביתר לקבורה ואמר רב מתנה אותו יום שנתנו הרוגי ביתר לקבורה תקנו ביבנה הטוב והמטיב הטוב שלא הסריחו והמטיב שנתנו לקבורה"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org", "text": "Rav Matanah said, \"It is the day that those killed in Beitar were given permission for burial.\" And Rav Matanah said,  \"On that day that those killed in Beitar were given permission for burial, they decreed [the blessing], 'the One who is good and the One who does good,' in Yavneh: 'the One who is good' - that they did not putrefy; 'and the One who does good' that they were given permission for burial.\""}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "http://sefaria.org"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - English", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.com/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99"}, {"language": "en", "languageFam